 "body": "Upgrading arduino-builder to 1.3.7, which changes the way messages are sent back to the IDE. Instead of having just stdour and stderr, stdout only is used, but each message has a log level: info, warn, debug, error.\nPlain stdout/stderr are still used by child processes\n",
